### 2. Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/driving-scene#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:EgoVehicle a ex:Vehicle .
ex:TargetVehicle a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:state "loss-of-control" ;
    ex:movement "transverse-slide" ;
    ex:location "tunnel-mid-lane" .

ex:Tunnel a ex:Infrastructure ;
    ex:condition "wet-surface" ;
    ex:lighting "low-light" .

ex:EgoVehicle ex:approaching ex:TargetVehicle .
ex:TargetVehicle ex:blockingPath ex:EgoVehicle .
ex:TargetVehicle ex:near ex:TunnelWall .
```

